{"id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-clark-equational-theory.md","title":"df Clark equational theory","display":"df Clark equational theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-clark-equational-theory","aliases":["72-df-clark-equational-theory"],"display":"df Clark equational theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 (E1), (E2) and DCA, print648–649/PDF660–661","verification_status":"source-definition-checked; explicit substitution encoding checked","proof_status":"definition-well-defined; no unification algorithm or equality-completeness theorem asserted","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-clark-equational-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-clark-equational-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df Clark equational theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 (E1), (E2) and DCA, print648–649/PDF660–661"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked; explicit substitution encoding checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined; no unification algorithm or equality-completeness theorem asserted"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 和四值结构取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a> 的接口；语法等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span> 与对象公式构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 分开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle\">\\(E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限项对序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。空合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，空析取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\\)</span> 是下式有限支撑代换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\">\\(t\\sigma\\)</span> 是同时项代换，合成先施 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 后施 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 以变量编号递增的顺序作全称闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span> 只用于该签名的四值结构。DCA 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cup F\">\\(C\\cup F\\)</span> 有限时定义；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y_f\">\\(\\vec y_f\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec y_f|=a_F(f)\">\\(|\\vec y_f|=a_F(f)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^V:|\\{x\\in V:\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\nx\\sigma&amp;:=\\sigma(x),\\qquad c\\sigma:=c\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\nf(\\vec t)\\sigma&amp;:=f((t_i\\sigma)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad(\\theta\\tau)(x):=(\\theta(x))\\tau,\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)&amp;:=\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}(a_i\\doteq b_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)&amp;:=\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}:\\forall i&lt;n\\ (a_i\\theta=b_i\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\ \\exists\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^V:|\\{x\\in V:\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\nx\\sigma&amp;:=\\sigma(x),\\qquad c\\sigma:=c\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\nf(\\vec t)\\sigma&amp;:=f((t_i\\sigma)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad(\\theta\\tau)(x):=(\\theta(x))\\tau,\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)&amp;:=\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}(a_i\\doteq b_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)&amp;:=\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}:\\forall i&lt;n\\ (a_i\\theta=b_i\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\ \\exists\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)):E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}((\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E))\\lor(c\\doteq d)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma},\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\forall s\\in D^V\\ (⟦ B⟧_{M,s}=\\mathsf t),\\\\\n\\mathsf{DCA}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\forall x\\left[\\bigvee_{c\\in C}(x\\doteq c)\\lor\\bigvee_{f\\in F}\\exists\\vec y_f\\,(x\\doteq f(\\vec y_f))\\right]\\quad(|C\\cup F|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)):E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}((\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E))\\lor(c\\doteq d)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma},\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\forall s\\in D^V\\ (⟦ B⟧_{M,s}=\\mathsf t),\\\\\n\\mathsf{DCA}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\forall x\\left[\\bigvee_{c\\in C}(x\\doteq c)\\lor\\bigvee_{f\\in F}\\exists\\vec y_f\\,(x\\doteq f(\\vec y_f))\\right]\\quad(|C\\cup F|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源是 IX §2.5 的两个公理模式及有限语言的域闭包公理。PDF660 的页图核对了 E1/E2 的方向、最一般合一子条件；DCA 的有限析取按 PDF661 的原式展开常元分支。所有表达式先是语法对象，闭包后的 CET 是纯等式公式的集合；它不含关系符号的合同公理。</p>\n<p>代换的项递归有唯一输出；有限支撑代换的合成仍有限支撑。MGU 这里只是明确定义的谓词，不把合一算法、MGU 的一般存在性或 Theorem 2.5.1 的等式完备性冒充本节点已经证明的结论。等式解释只取共同域、常元和函数解释，因此 EqBase 在同基底的关系解释间不变。Herbrand 基底满足这些公理；任意身份等号的基底未必满足，例如不同常元可被解释成同一元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$、$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ 和四值结构取 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的接口；语法等号 $=$ 与对象公式构造子 $\\doteq$ 分开。$n\\in\\omega$，$E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i<n\\rangle$ 为有限项对序列；$c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$。空合取为 $\\top$，空析取为 $\\bot$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i<n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"t\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\cup F","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y_f","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec y_f|=a_F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}&:=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^V:|\\{x\\in V:\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}|<\\omega\\},\\\\\nx\\sigma&:=\\sigma(x),\\qquad c\\sigma:=c\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\nf(\\vec t)\\sigma&:=f((t_i\\sigma)_{i<a_F(f)}),\\qquad(\\theta\\tau)(x):=(\\theta(x))\\tau,\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}&:=(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)&:=\\bigwedge_{i<n}(a_i\\doteq b_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)&:=\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}:\\forall i<n\\ (a_i\\theta=b_i\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)\\ \\exists\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(A)&:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad\\left(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j<k\\},\\ i_0<\\cdots<i_{k-1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}&:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)):E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}((\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E))\\lor(c\\doteq d)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma},\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\forall s\\in D^V\\ (⟦ B⟧_{M,s}=\\mathsf t),\\\\\n\\mathsf{DCA}_{\\Sigma}&:=\\forall x\\left[\\bigvee_{c\\in C}(x\\doteq c)\\lor\\bigvee_{f\\in F}\\exists\\vec y_f\\,(x\\doteq f(\\vec y_f))\\right]\\quad(|C\\cup F|<\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3920,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-clark-equational-theory|df Clark equational theory]]"},{"id":"62a32ca4e63fca90","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$、$\\sim$ 如 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]，$D_R^P$ 如 [[72-df-program-definition-form]]；$\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Unif}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{MGU}_\\Sigma$ 与同时项代换如 [[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]。$r,n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"86860ecaa6585b53","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CET}_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-clark-equational-theory]] 的纯等式理论，在 $\\Sigma^\\pm$ 中视为相同的公式集合。$\\varepsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}$，对每个 $R$ 取互异变量元组 $\\vec x_R,\\vec y_R$，长度均为 $a_R(R)$；$D_R^P$ 的局部绑定变量先改名避免捕获。$\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)$ 是下式引入的理论，所有公理都是全称闭合句子。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-clark-equational-theory|df Clark equational theory]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-clark-equational-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["40bb12b12b7a39e7"]}